            "genre_description": "A character-driven drama with strong romantic elements, structured as a psychological drama. The show emphasizes interpersonal conflict, interiority, and moral ambiguity typical of contemporary drama, while its romantic subplot explores attraction, betrayal, and longing. The psychological-drama subgenre focuses on characters’ motivations, cognitive dissonance, and emotional complexity rather than plot-driven action.",
            "style_description": "Visually intimate and carefully composed, the style favors close framing, naturalistic performances, and a muted, aesthetic color palette that underscores emotional nuance. Direction leans lyrical and atmospheric, using understated camerawork, restrained editing, and a curated soundtrack to create a contemplative mood. The overall approach balances cinematic polish with an observational, almost documentary sensitivity to everyday detail.",
